<title>GREECE: ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 8.</title>
<headline>ATHLETICS-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS TIMETABLE - AUGUST 8.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timetable for the seventh day of</p>
<p>competition at the world athletics championships on Friday (all</p>
<p>times GMT):</p>
<p>1430 - Men's pole vault qualifying round, two groups</p>
<p>1430 - Men's discus qualifying round, group A</p>
<p>1545 - Men's triple jump final</p>
<p>1605 - Women's 200 metres final</p>
<p>1620 - Men's 200 metres final</p>
<p>1630 - Women's high jump qualifying round, two groups</p>
<p>1630 - Men's discus qualifying round, group B</p>
<p>1640 - Men's 800 metres final</p>
<p>1700 - Women's 400 metres hurdles final</p>
<p>1720 - Women's 4x100 metres relay semifinals</p>
<p>1750 - Men's 5,000 metres semifinals</p>
</text>
